      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can four families share Villa Espada?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Four families of four fit in the full 8-bedroom estate with two en-suite bedrooms each: parents in one (twin-XL pairs join into kings) and children in the other (twin-XL beds split apart, or the two queens in a streetside room). Six of the eight bedrooms also have a Murphy bed for an extra child. In peak season the full estate is $4,500 a night for up to 16 guests, about $1,125 per family per night, with the private chef, butler, housekeeping, airport transfers and two golf carts included." }
